[Placeholder for Bolsa de Empleo ERD Diagram]
Entities: JobOffer, Company, User, Application, Category
Relationships: 
- JobOffer -> Company (ManyToOne)
- JobOffer -> Category (ManyToMany)
- JobOffer -> User (ManyToOne for applications)
- User -> Application (OneToOne)
- JobOffer <-> Application (OneToMany)